rder of includes, and in some cases the order of executed code (such as `Engine::get_singleton()->add_singleton`), which should not change behavior in any meaningful way (if it does, that's a bug). This is a minor cleanup on top of some recent refactors.\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n- Organizes related code to avoid having more `#ifdef` and `#ifndef` directives than necessary, such as in World2D.\r\n- Tries to make the order of these new directives consistent. The order shouldn't matter, so alphabetical: **n**avigation, then **p**hysics, then **x**r, and that also seems to be the dominant order already present in master.\r\n    - Note: If the order does matter somewhere, we should add a comment to explicitly note that.\r\n- Fixes a few cases where `_3D_DISABLED` was used in place of `XR_DISABLED`.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62992